<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ENGIMA | ASE</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@700;800&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    /* GLOBAL RESET */
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    /* UNIQUE HEADING STYLE */
    h1, h2, .display-5 {
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    /* NEW UNIQUE STYLE FOR WELCOME TEXT */
    .welcome-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.5rem) !important; 
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif !important;
      font-style: italic;
      text-transform: none !important;
      letter-spacing: 0px !important;
      margin-top: 20px;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    /* LOGO SPECIFIC STYLING - UPDATED FOR SIZE AND ROUNDED EDGES */
    .logo-square {
      width: 160px; /* Made a little bigger */
      height: 160px; /* Made a little bigger */
      object-fit: contain;
      border-radius: 20px; /* Rounded edges */
      transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .logo-square:hover {
      transform: scale(1.2); /* Makes it come forward */
      box-shadow: 0px 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    /* ANIMATIONS */
    .fade-in {
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease-out forwards;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
      }
    }

    /* SECTIONS */
    .container {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 50px 20px;
    }

    .hero-section {
      height: 60vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .content-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 50px;
      margin-bottom: 100px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .content-row.reverse {
      flex-direction: row-reverse;
    }

    /* IMAGE STYLING */
    .img-wrapper {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 300px;
    }

    .custom-img {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 450px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 20px 20px 0px #e0e0e0;
      transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
    }

    .custom-img:hover {
      transform: translate(-10px, -10px);
      box-shadow: 30px 30px 0px #d4d4d4;
    }

    .text-wrapper {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 300px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .section-title::after {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      width: 60px;
      height: 4px;
      background: #1a1a1a;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    .lead {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: #333;
    }

    .register-link {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      background-color: #1a1a1a;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 5px;
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }

    .register-link:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      background-color: #333;
    }

    .meta-info {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .content-row { text-align: center; }
      .section-title::after { margin: 10px auto; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container hero-section fade-in">
    <img src="img/last.png" alt="ASE Logo" class="logo-square">
    <h1 class="welcome-title">Welcome to ASE</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    
    <div class="content-row fade-in">
      <div class="img-wrapper">
        <img src="img/RC.JPEG" class="custom-img" alt="Recruitment">
      </div>
      <div class="text-wrapper">
        <h2 class="section-title">Recruitments Are Back</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Join a forward-thinking community dedicated to fostering innovation in engineering and data sciences. We are looking for passionate individuals to join our technical, media, and event management teams.
        </p>
        <div class="meta-info">
          📅 31st January | 1:30 PM<br>
          📍 Idealab, Room 344 (D Block)
        </div>
        <a href="https://forms.gle/LryTHV85ga86nPAN7" target="_blank" class="register-link">Register Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-row reverse fade-in">
      <div class="img-wrapper">
        <img src="img/Q3.jpeg" class="custom-img" alt="KREA AI">
      </div>
      <div class="text-wrapper">
        <h2 class="section-title">KREA AI</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          The ASE Club prioritizes technical growth by integrating modern generative tools. We explore KREA AI to push the boundaries of real-time art and visual design within our technology ecosystem.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-row fade-in">
      <div class="img-wrapper">
        <img src="img/Q4.jpeg" class="custom-img" alt="Perplexity">
      </div>
      <div class="text-wrapper">
        <h2 class="section-title">Perplexity AI</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          Verified research is the backbone of engineering excellence. We utilize Perplexity AI to ensure our projects are grounded in the latest, most accurate technical data available.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-row reverse fade-in">
      <div class="img-wrapper">
        <img src="img/3h.jpeg" class="custom-img" alt="Veo 3">
      </div>
      <div class="text-wrapper">
        <h2 class="section-title">VEO 3</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          From text to video, we explore the future of content creation. Led by Kalyan Reddy Kandula, our team experiments with Veo 3 to create immersive digital experiences.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>